SUMMARY:Student Mobilization Committee Oopen Meeting - by Student
  Mobilization Committee Toronto
LOCATION:252 Bloor St W
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DU3XHYFjnxi/\n\nHosted
  by Student Mobilization Committee Toronto
  (https://www.instagram.com/smc.toronto/)\n\nThe SMC will be hosting an
  open meeting to discuss a collective plan of action regarding the recent
  announcements by the Ministry of Colleges\, Universities\, Research and
  Excellence and Security. Open to all who are interested in combatting the
  provincial government’s decisions to prioritize loans over grants and
  hike up tuition.
END:VEVENT
