SUMMARY:Sensual Tuesday Class and Social
DESCRIPTION:Sensual Tuesday!\nBachata and Salsa Classes Latin Dance Social after Classes in AUSTIN TEXAS\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nWHAT IS SENSUAL TUESDAY?\nJoin us every Tuesday to learn and improve your Salsa and Bachata! Each week we host introduction and multi-level\, progressive classes so that anyone at any dance level can join in on the fun. After classes\, practice what you learned with our Sensual Tuesday Social (BYOB\, Music sets: Bachata\, Salsa\, Zouk\, and more)!
