DESCRIPTION:Get ready to use your imagination and bring your dream room to
  life with stickers! In this fun\, hands-on program\, you’ll design and 
 decorate your very own “sticker room” using a step-by-step guide to he
 lp spark ideas and get you started.\nChoose a theme\, pick your favorite s
 tickers\, and arrange everything just the way you like it. It’s complete
 ly up to you! We’ll provide the supplies and helpful tips you bring the
  creativity. By the end of the program\, you’ll have a unique sticker ro
 om creation to take home and show off. No experience needed\, just come re
 ady to have fun and get creative!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub servi
 ce. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the sum
 mer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks 
 are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch
  to find out more.
