DESCRIPTION:Returning for its 21st edition\, featuring over 70 shows and o
 ver 75 comedy troupes!\n\nWe're showcasing the best contemporary sketch co
 medy\, musical comedy\, drag\, storytelling\, and clown from across North 
 America\, plus the ninth annual Film Festival presented by New Metric Medi
 a.\n\nHighlights include headliner performances by Sex T-Rex\, Jon Blair\,
  BDB Comedy\, and Tita Collective\, plus a full day of International Women
 ’s Day programming\, featuring all female and non-binary performers.\n\n
 Categories: Comedy\, Film\, Live Performances\nPrice: 25.00
