SUMMARY:Language Exchange - Speak English & Speak Spanish Online
DESCRIPTION:Language Exchange Toronto - Se Habla English & Spanish\n**Span
 ish Language Conversation Toronto** is part of ***Se Habla***\, a worldwid
 e community made up of 9 Meetup groups from 9 different cities across 6 co
 untries. Join us and don't miss the opportunity to speak with native speak
 ers.\n\n**Five years of meeting online.** Don’t wait—become part of ou
 r supportive international network of like-minded people and make friends 
 all over the world. Free forever after One-Time Donation.\n\n**We meet on 
 the following days:**\n\n* Monday 8 pm\n* Wednesday 8 pm\n* Sunday 11 am\n
 \nThe average attendance per meeting is 40 participants.\n\n**Format**\nDe
 pending on attendance and nationality\, small groups are formed with 4-6 p
 eople:\n\n* 2 native English speakers\n* 2 native Spanish speakers\n* 1 na
 tive speaker of another language\n\nThe meetings last for 2 hours and are 
 divided into 4 periods:\n\n* 30 minutes speaking in English\n* 30 minutes 
 speaking in Spanish\n* 30 minutes speaking in English\n* 30 minutes speaki
 ng in Spanish\n\nPlease note that **we speak half of the time in English a
 nd half in Spanish.** We help each other learn both languages.\n\n**After 
 two hours**\, everyone returns to the main room to meet all participants a
 nd take a group screenshot. If you have time\, you’re welcome to stay an
 d continue the conversation for as long as you like.\n\n**Community**\n**W
 e have 9 MeetUp groups meeting at the same time** (Mexico City\, Calgary\,
  Vancouver\, Toronto\, New York\, London\, Los Angeles\, Medellin\, and Sa
 ntiago de Chile). However\, during the exchange\, you will meet people not
  only from these cities but also from all over the world.\n\nYou can get t
 he link to our 9 MeetUp groups by visiting any of the following pages:\n[h
 ttps://se-habla.com/spanish-meetup/](https://se-habla.com/spanish-meetup/)
 \n[https://se-habla.com/english-meetup/](https://se-habla.com/english-meet
 up/)\n\n**One-Time Donation**\nFor over four years\, the meetings were fre
 e\, but starting last October\, I am requesting a **ONE-TIME DONATION** to
  access the meetings and help to cover the costs of the 9 MeetUp Groups.\n
 \nYou can make the one-time donation at the link below. Afterward\, PayPal
  will redirect you to a page where you'll find the Zoom link to join the m
 eeting.\n[https://se-habla.com/language-exchange/](https://se-habla.com/la
 nguage-exchange/)\n\nIf you have already made a donation and don't have th
 e Zoom link\, please contact me.\n\n**Please don’t hesitate to reach out
  if you have any further questions.**\n\nSee you soon\,\n**Héctor Fuentes
 **
