DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DVMjuGsDzUf/\n\nHosted
  by OPIRG York (https://www.opirgyork.org/)\n\nAfter 100 years of
  remembering Black history and past achievements\, it is time to celebrate
