 is\, hands-on program\, you’ll use a simple step-by-step guide to help p
 lan your design and bring your ideas to life.\nChoose your colors\, add fu
 n designs\, words\, or patterns\, and decorate your tote bag however you l
 ike! We’ll provide the tote bags and decorating supplies you just bring 
 your imagination. No experience needed\, just come ready to have fun and c
 reate!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcom
 ing place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff a
 re always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by
  a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
