UID:698bade64a9fd98b7f7d4b11@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Rubik’s Pixel Art combines creativity and problem-solving by
  using Rubik’s Cubes to create vibrant pixel art portraits. Participants
  learn basic cube-solving techniques while developing spatial awareness\, 
 logic\, and artistic skills in a fun\, hands-on environment. This program 
 is led by Mikael Taieb\, founder of Dreampics Pixel Art.\nThis program is 
 part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens afte
 r school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Fr
 ee\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth 
 Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
