SUMMARY:Building a Culture and Practice of Community Care on Campus - by
  TMU Office of Social Innovation
LOCATION:Daphne Cockwell Complex
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/building-a-culture-and-practice-of-community-
 care-on-campus-new-date-tickets-1981876739679\n\nHosted by TMU Office of
  Social Innovation
  (https://www.torontomu.ca/social-innovation/)\n\nFeaturing disability
  justice scholar and care collective organizer\, Dr. Loree Erickson\, and
  collective care artist–researcher and TMU alum\, L. Morris\, this
  conversation and workshop will take up how we care for one another in
  university.
END:VEVENT
