SUMMARY:A History of Girl Gangs\, Non-binary Skateboarders and Skate Zines
  - by Toronto Public Library
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696812191f01fb76cec5af2c\n\nHoste
 d by Toronto Public Library
  (https://www.torontopubliclibrary.ca)\n\nCelebrate International Women's
  Day by learning about a unique\, untold history of women and non-binary
  skateboarders! Join Natalie Porter\, author of a new book on the unsung
  women\, BIPOC pioneers\, and queer trailblazers who helped shape
  skateboarding.
END:VEVENT
