DESCRIPTION:Beyond Boundaries \n\n\n\nA short swim (accessible water chair lift available) followed by a social gathering afterwards\, this program offers something for all. Board games\, cards\, arts/crafts or just interesting conversation are always available. Light refreshments and healthy snacks are served. \n\n\n\nDay: Tuesdays and Thursdays Time: 6 pm – 8 pm Session: Winter 2026: Jan 13 – March 12 Place: Scadding Court CC\, Pool & Room 1
