X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://musictorontoconcerts.com/concerts/leonkoro-quartet"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Leonkoro Quartet
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T193000
UID:12f2faf1e4e1a7ab957def6ca645632e@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Since its formation in Berlin in 2019\, the quartet has garner
 ed more awards and honors than any other ensemble of its generation. \n\nW
 ith Jonathan and Lukas Schwartz on first violin and cello\, and Amellie Wa
 llner and Mayu Konoe on second violin and viola\, the quartet’s name is 
 derived from the Esperanto words “Leon” and “koro\,” together mean
 ing “Lionheart.”\n\nThe quartet has earned a reputation not only for i
 ts technical brilliance and bold artistic risk-taking\, but also for its d
 eep sensitivity to the unique sonority and emotional landscape of each wor
 k it performs. Enjoy their program of Joseph Haydn: String Quartet  in D M
 ajor\, Op. 20\, No. 4\, Henriëtte Bosmans: String Quartet (1927) and Fran
 z Schubert: String Quartet in D minor\, D. 810 "Death and the Maiden".\n\n
 \nCategories: Cultural\, Live Performances\, Music
LOCATION:Jane Mallett Theatre\, St. Lawrence Centre for the Arts\, 27 Fron
 t St E\, Toronto\, ON\, M5E 1B4
URL:https://musictorontoconcerts.com/concerts/leonkoro-quartet
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
