SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Gem Stone Mining
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T203000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T213000Z
UID:69a080ed4a9fd98b7f80ba93@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Put on your explorer mindset and excavate hidden gemstones bur
 ied inside mystery mineral blocks! Use real excavation tools to chisel\, b
 rush\, and uncover sparkling crystals and stones waiting to be discovered.
 \nNo registration necessary. Supplies are limited.\nThis program is part o
 f Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after scho
 ol and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, n
 utritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\no
 r call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Woodside Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a080ed4a9fd98b7f80ba93
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
