BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Botanical Garden": "https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/drawing-butterflies-with-pen-ink-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_botanical
X-SOURCE:Toronto Botanical Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260307T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260307T160000
DTSTAMP:20260303T164456
CREATED:20260109T180216Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260109T183953Z
UID:10001911-1772888400-1772899200@torontobotanicalgarden.ca
SUMMARY:Drawing Butterflies with Pen & Ink
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun-filled afternoon of creating beautiful butterfly art using pen and ink\, where creativity takes flight!\n\n\nIn this workshop you’ll be drawing mounted Butterfly specimens up close where you can see every detail. Your instructor will lead you through every stage of the process with group demonstrations and individual attention. Beginners welcome. \nThe following art materials will be provided: \n1 sheet of Fine Art Paper \n1 Japanese Drawing Pencil \n1 Black Fineliner Pen \nOptional materials to bring: \nA basic set of colour pencils \nSaturday\, March 7 from 1 to 4 p.m. \nRegistration: Public $75\, TBG Members $65 (plus applicable taxes and fees) \nAbout Alan Li \nAlan Li is an artist focused on nature. He supports conservation efforts through the sale of his artwork and is active in volunteering. Alan believes drawing can open people’s eyes to the planet’s diversity and show them that it matters. Alan grew up near the Niagara Escarpment and spent much of his childhood exploring the cliffs and forests. Those early encounters with nature have influenced both the direction of his life and the choice of subjects for his art. He currently pursues his own projects\, teaches workshops\, and collaborates with grassroots environmental groups. \nwww.alanlidrawings.com \n  \nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member ! \n  \nAdditional Program Information\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/drawing-butterflies-with-pen-ink-2/
LOCATION:ON
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/aea60d49c2a852441503862000bfcf4d.jpg
END:VEVENT
