SUMMARY:Intrigue at the Museum: A Mystery Scavenger Hunt at ROM
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260307T140000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260530T140000
UID:3d659210c3bbb2935aaffeca559b2eab@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand!\n\nThere has been a mysterious murder\
 , and the museum's collections hold the key.  As you gather clues\, you’
 ll begin to piece together a tale of greed\, lust\, pride\, and revenge. W
 orking in teams\, sleuths travel through the museum's galleries solving wh
 odunnit\, where\, and with what. Will your team solve the mystery before t
 he clock runs out?\n\nAt least one player per team must bring a phone with
  our scavenger hunt app downloaded for submitting answers and creative tea
 m photos and videos during the adventure\, but the more the merrier! \n\nC
 ategories: History\, Museum\, Trivia\nPrice: 47.50
LOCATION:Royal Ontario Museum\, 100 Queen's Park\, Toronto\, ON\, M5S 2C6
