DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing the excitement of the Olympic and Paralympic 
 Winter Games Milano Cortina 2026 to Palmerston Library with a Watch Party
 !\nJoin Palmerston as we present CBC/Radio-Canada’s broadcast of The Par
