SUMMARY:Family Day
DESCRIPTION:Family Day            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Sundays\n11:00 am – 3:00 pm\nMakerspace\, Ground Floor\nFree for kids and included with admission for adults and seniors. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Families can connect over clay in our brand new Makerspace with weekly activities inspired by our collection and special exhibitions and led by our amazing team of educators and volunteers. We invite you to engage with materials like unfired clay\, fabric\, and paper to make collages inspired by the special exhibition Linda Rotua Sormin: Uncertain Ground. Explore Sormin’s multisensory installation on our third floor\, then get creative as a family in our Makerspace! \nWe recommend bringing a recycled container or bag in which to transport your work home. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
