SUMMARY:Walk for Women's Day
DESCRIPTION:On Sun March 8th\, International Women’s Day\, Boulderz will have a fundraising moment for women facing breast cancer. As more women rely on CURE for essentials—food\, housing\, medical costs\, and transportation—support has never mattered more. \nInspired by Emily\,a rock climber\, who was diagnosed at 24\, this campaign shows the power of showing up together. \nWalk for Women’s Day \nDonate to walk the Slack line on top of the U-Boulder \nSunday March 8th \n3pm-5pm \nBoulderz Etobicoke 80 The East Mall unit 9 \nDonation required and admission to be able to walk the line \nDONATE to CURE Foundation Charity
