SUMMARY:Logo Design with Adobe Illustrator
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260310T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260310T233000Z
UID:6973aa3a1e64afd01e5638c9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn the ins and outs of vector design using Adobe Illustrato
 r CC. We will talk about the differences between vector and raster images\
 , explore some of the beginner tools at our disposal\, and then use these 
 tools to design a small vector drawing.\nThis class is for beginners but a
 ssumes you have a basic understanding  of computer skills. Computers will 
 be provided for this class.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto \nPublic Library unde
 r the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, \nand 20(d). The inf
 ormation will only be used for event and program \nregistration\, delivery
  and evaluation. Questions about how the library \nhandles your informatio
 n can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-59
 81\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6973aa3a1e64afd01e5638c9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
