SUMMARY:Animation with Piskel for Kids
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260311T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260311T210000Z
UID:69a72c9d491b809c6f1dd220@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Kids will learn how to make a simple pixel animation using the
  online Piskel app. Piskel can be used to create simple game sprites (i.e.
 \, 2D images overlaid onto a scene)\, GIF animations\, and pixel-art for s
 ocial media.\nThis program was designed for children ages 8 and up.\nRegis
 tration is required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
 on. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direct
 ed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge 
 Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Sanderson\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a72c9d491b809c6f1dd220
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
