SUMMARY:TD Union Beats March : DJ LUVBUG
DESCRIPTION:DJ LUVBUG is a genre-fluid DJ known for playful\, high-energy sets and unexpected blends. With a deep love for digging\, she pulls rare edits\, remixes\, and nostalgic cuts alongside global sounds — from hip-hop\, R&B\, house\, afrobeats\, and dance to Latin grooves and underground gems. Her style is intuitive and dynamic\, building moments that feel curated yet effortless. Whether soundtracking a brand launch\, fashion event\, or creative gathering\, DJ LUVBUG delivers immersive vibes\, seamless transitions\, and a dance floor that feels both elevated and electric. \nIG : @JUBILEEBUGG
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/td-union-beats-march-dj-luvbug-6/
