SUMMARY:Vegetarian Sushi Making Workshop with Chef Sang Kim
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T213000Z
UID:69554bd4491b809c6f102e35@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto celebrity chef\, Sang Kim\, teaches the basics of sush
 i-making. Participants make sushi rolls using ingredients prepared by the 
 Chef and eat their own creations. A brief history of sushi\, its origins a
 nd eating etiquette will also be shared.​\n(No raw fish is used. Ingredi
 ents are free of gluten\, nuts and dairy.)\nThis is a drop in program for 
 teens. No registration required.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69554bd4491b809c6f102e35
