 t the garrison schoolroom to practice slate writing and learn how soldiers
 ’ children were taught. \n\nFor an additional fee of $5 +HST\, children 
 (aged six to 12 years old) can participate in a Jumbles baking workshop in
  the Officers' Mess Kitchen. Learn more and purchase tickets below.\nCateg
 ories: Family/Children\, History\, Museum\nFree event
