SUMMARY:The SATURDAY NIGHT ALL GREEN ST. PADDY'S BASH! (Pubs\, Band\, DJ &
  Dancing)
DESCRIPTION:IMPROV\, ACTING\, NATURE WALKS and KARAOKE CLUB!\nHello everyo
 ne\,\n\n**Kindly Read Carefully:**\n\nPlease join us for a unique **St. Pa
 ddy's** experience as we hit\, not one but two great places to mix\, mingl
 e and dance the night away with Live Music\, Band\, DJ and awesome people!
 \n\nFirst we will meet at ***Duke of Kent (2nd Floor) You can ask the host
 ess at the front to direct you to Steve's group upstairs)*** (Conveniently
  located extremely close Yonge & Eglinton corner. (2 minute walk north fro
 m the subway station)\n\nThe next venue is only minutes away from there (s
 ecret location)\n\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Duke of Kent:** You will be di
 rected upstairs to there cool party room area :)\n**Date:** Saturday March
  14th\, 2026\n**Address:** 2315 Yonge Street Toronto\, ON M4P 2X9\n**Arriv
 e between:** 6:00 pm and 7:45 pm (if you can)\n(Encouraged earlier rather 
 than later to have a chance to meet everyone and soak up a great Saturday 
 night)\n\n**Highlights:**\n\\*Reserved tables and seating for dinner\, coc
 ktails and mingling\n\\*Venue is very close to the Yonge and Eglinton subw
 ay station\n\\*Ice breaker game to make it easy to meet and connect with e
 veryone :)\n\\*A fun game to win complimentary beverages :)\n\\*Live Music
  (Band) (DJ) and dancing at our second secret location\n\n\\*Dress casual 
 or dress up if you like :)\n**DRESS IN Green and have a Chance to win Swee
 ts and Treats :)**\n\n-Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can an
 ticipate an awesome St. Paddy's Bash to remember!\n\n\\*One beverage or ap
 petizer minimum at the first and second location-(No loitering please)\nTh
 ank you very much and remember to Tip your Servers :)\n\\*a 3rd venue may 
 be an option too depending on how everyone is feeling :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nhttps://ww
 w.meetup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nEvent Deta
 ils:\n**The SATURDAY NIGHT ALL GREEN ST. PADDY'S BASH!**\n**(Pubs\, Band\,
  DJ & Dancing)**\n\n-We will meet ***upstairs in their party bar room area
 \;*** connect with everyone\, ice breaker game\, socialize\, share some la
 ughs\, then make our way new our surprise location with live music\, DJ\, 
 super fun atmosphere\, great people and dancing :)\n\\*Plan to come for di
 nner too if you like at the first venue\, as tables will be reserved for e
 veryone\n\n(All Venues will be close walking distance for us)\n\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\n**EVENT FEE:**\n\n**Night of Event- Saturday March 14th (Arrival Tim
 es)**\n\n**\\*Ladies and Gents- Dress in Green if you can :)**\n-10 dollar
 s if you arrive between (6:00 pm and 7:30 pm)\n-15 dollars if you arrive b
 etween (7:31 pm and 8:50 pm)\n\nIf you arrive after that you will simply m
 iss the event :)\n**(cash or by e transfer to steveflemming11@gmail.com)**
 \n\n**DRESS IN GREEN and have a Chance to Win! :)**\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
