DESCRIPTION:IMPROV\, ACTING\, NATURE WALKS and KARAOKE CLUB!\nHello everyo
 ne\,\n\nPlease join us for our a great afternoon with **IMPROV and ACTING 
 in the PUB.**\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a g
 reat afternoon\n\n\\*\\*Stick around after as well for our weekly traditio
