SUMMARY:March Break Camp: Teen Wheel (Ages 13 - 17)
DESCRIPTION:March Break Camp: Teen Wheel (Ages 13 – 17)            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n			\nEvents\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n			\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Monday March 16 – Friday March 20\, 2026\n1:00 pm – 4:o0 pm \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Join us for a week of clay and creativity this March Break! Teens ages 13 – 17 will explore wheel-throwing techniques to create their own functional\, sculptural\, and decorative pottery. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n\n        \n          \n          \n                        \n               \n                Gardiner Friends : $234\n                                        \n                        \n               \n                General : $275\n                                        \n                      \n\n           \n            \n              Gardiner Friends\, log in to access your discount.* \nNot a Gardiner Friend yet? Join now at the Friend level or above to save . \n*Discounts on programs and classes do not apply to ‘Annual Pass’ level. \n            \n                    \n          \n            \n  \n            \n                \n                                    SOLD OUT\n                \n                            \n           \n                \n                \n                    \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n          \n          \n        \n\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Important Information: \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    \nPlease ensure the course you choose works with your schedule. For any withdrawals\, a non-refundable fee of $30 fee per course will be charged\, regardless of the reason for withdrawal. Withdrawals will not be accepted for any reason within 10 business days prior to the program start date or after the program has begun.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBy signing up for this class\, participants are committing to abide by the Museum’s Code of Conduct\, Ticketing Policy\, and Studio Policy.\n\nGardiner Friends\, please log in to access your discount and front-of-the-line access. Gardiner Friends may only purchase kids camps at the discounted rate for membership card holders’ children and grandchildren. \n\n\n\n\n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/march-break-camp-teen-wheel-ages-13-17-2026/
LOCATION:Gardiner Museum\, 111 Queen's Park\, Toronto\, ON\, M5S 2C7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Kids Camps
