SUMMARY:Healthy Eating Series from Birth to 6 Years
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260316T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260316T160000Z
UID:6966accc8b29ea2800c93e6e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Healthy Eating Series by Toronto Public Health for Birth to Si
 x years by Toronto Public Health\, presented in partnership with Working W
 omen Community Centre.\nThese workshops are designed for\nparents and care
 givers of children from birth to 6 years\nand will be led by Azar Mehrabia
 n\, Community Nutrition Educator with Toronto Public Health.\nThe workshop
  topics are:\nFebruary 2: Eating Healthy on a budget\, 2-3 PM:\nTips for 
 meal planning\nHow to maximize the household grocery budget "Best buys" in
  all food categories\nHow to minimize food waste\nMarch 2: Food and Mood\
 , 2-3 PM:\nRelationship between food and mood\nCommon foods that support p
 ositive moods\nHow mood affects food choices\nMindful eating\nMarch 16: H
 ealthy Lunches and Snacks\, 11 AM - 12 PM:\nKey consideration when plannin
 g healthy lunches & snacks for children 2 to 6 years\nQuick and healthy lu
 nch and snack ideas\nFood safety tips when packing lunches and snacks\nMar
 ch 30: Mealtime Environments and Feeding Relationship\,\n11 AM - 12 PM:\n
 Healthy eating environment and feeding relationship\nCommon feeding challe
 nges for toddlers and preschoolers and tips to overcome them\nHow to allow
  children to follow their hunger and fullness cues\nHow to involve childre
 n in food skills\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information
  on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public 
 Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will o
 nly be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. 
 Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed t
 o Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Stre
 et\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6966accc8b29ea2800c93e6e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
