  Public Library!  Families are invited to roll up their sleeves\, plant t
 heir own seeds\, and explore how tiny sprouts turn into fresh\, nutritious
  greens. Through hands-on activities\, children and caregivers will learn 
 what plants need to grow and experience the wonder of growing food togethe
 r and learning new recipes. Perfect for curious minds and little green thu
 mbs!\nLearn sprouts and microgreens and how to grow them\nKnow some health
  benefits in eating sprouts\nDiscover how to use them in various recipes\n
 Drop-in only\n\, no large groups\nAccessibility\nLive or automated closed 
