X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Language Exchange Toronto": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto/events/313516399/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_lang_exchange_to
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Language Exchange Toronto
UID:event_313516399@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260303T215743Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260316T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260316T220000
SUMMARY:Conversation in Spanish & English Practice Online
DESCRIPTION:Language Exchange Toronto - Se Habla English & Spanish\n**Engl
 ish and Spanish Language Exchange Toronto** is part of ***Se Habla***\, a 
 worldwide community made up of 9 Meetup groups from 9 different cities acr
 oss 6 countries. Join us and don't miss the opportunity to speak with nati
 ve speakers.\n\n**Five years of meeting online.** Don’t wait—become pa
 rt of our supportive international network of like-minded people and make 
 friends all over the world. Free forever after One-Time Donation.\n\n**We 
 meet on the following days:**\n\n* Monday 8 pm\n* Wednesday 8 pm\n* Sunday
  11 am\n\nThe average attendance per meeting is 40 participants.\n\n**Form
 at**\n**Conversation Rooms (Intermediate and Advanced)**\nDepending on att
 endance and nationality\, small groups are formed with 4-6 people:\n\n* 2 
 native English speakers\n* 2 native Spanish speakers\n* 1 native speaker o
 f another language\n\nThe meetings last for 2 hours and are divided into 4
  periods:\n\n* 30 minutes speaking in English\n* 30 minutes speaking in Sp
 anish\n* 30 minutes speaking in English\n* 30 minutes speaking in Spanish\
 n\n**Beginner Room A1 and A2 (Mondays Only)**\nStart: 8:30 pm\nDuration: 1
  hour\nWelcome\, English and Spanish beginners.\n\nPlease note that **we s
 peak half of the time in English and half in Spanish.** We help each other
  learn both languages.\n\n**After two hours**\, everyone returns to the ma
 in room to meet all participants and take a group screenshot. If you have 
 time\, you’re welcome to stay and continue the conversation for as long 
 as you like.\n\n**Community**\n**We have 9 MeetUp groups meeting at the sa
 me time** (Mexico City\, Calgary\, Vancouver\, Toronto\, New York\, London
 \, Los Angeles\, Medellin\, and Santiago de Chile). However\, during the e
 xchange\, you will meet people not only from these cities but also from al
 l over the world.\n\nYou can get the link to our 9 MeetUp groups by visiti
 ng any of the following pages:\n[https://se-habla.com/spanish-meetup/](htt
 ps://se-habla.com/spanish-meetup/)\n[https://se-habla.com/english-meetup/]
 (https://se-habla.com/english-meetup/)\n\n**One-Time Donation**\nFor over 
 four years\, the meetings were free\, but starting last October\, I am req
 uesting a **ONE-TIME DONATION** to access the meetings and help to cover t
 he costs of the 9 MeetUp Groups.\n\nYou can make the one-time donation at 
 the link below. Afterward\, PayPal will redirect you to a page where you'l
 l find the Zoom link to join the meeting.\n[https://se-habla.com/language-
 exchange/](https://se-habla.com/language-exchange/)\n\nIf you have already
  made a donation and don't have the Zoom link\, please contact me.\n\n**Pl
 ease don’t hesitate to reach out if you have any further questions.**\n\
 nSee you soon\,\n**Héctor Fuentes**
