SUMMARY:Pixel Art Animation with Piskel
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260316T213000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260316T233000Z
UID:699cfbff4dacf581ff7d739c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make a simple pixel animation using the online Pi
 skel app. Piskel can be used to create simple game sprites (i.e.\, 2D imag
 es overlaid onto a scene)\, GIF animations\, and pixel-art for social medi
 a.\nSuitable for ages 9 and up.\nEquipment will be provided for this class
 .\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal
  information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under
  the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The inform
 ation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and 
 evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information can b
 e directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 78
 9 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, 2nd floor Digital Innovation Hub
