 ployment law relevant to everyday workers from employee rights related to 
 being fired or laid off to employment standards\, Employment Insurance (EI
 )\, WSIB claims\, and more.\nRegistration is encouraged.\nDrop-ins are we
 lcome until capacity is reached.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
 onal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library u
 nder the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The in
