DESCRIPTION:Join our free March Break Club for newcomer youth ages 14-18.
   Participants should expect: Art and creative activities\, Employment wo
 rkshops\, Field trips and volunteer hours.  Snacks\, refreshments and Lun
 ch are provided.\nQuestions? Contact Nasim: 647-332-5711 or email nzand@ny
 ch.ca\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\,
  North York Community House & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Richview
