SUMMARY:WonderPhil Magic Show!
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T154500Z
UID:699603ae8d5e2d09335ff11f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:March Break MAGIC SHOW!\nJoin WonderPhil for amazing magic\, h
 uge laughs\, and lots of audience interaction & volunteers. Throughout the
  fast-paced show\, things will appear\, vanish\, come to life\, and so muc
 h more.\nThis program is for children of all ages & their caregivers.\nDro
