DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T140000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T153000Z
UID:696ebac91a99273737901d72@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of the original\nMuppet Movie\n(PG) an
 d play BINGO along the way!
