 th Jasper Bryan\, an expressive arts therapist. This program is a welcomin
 g\, hands-on activity that introduces you to the arts and builds community
 . Participants will receive all the supplies needed to design their own un
 ique cookie while having fun connecting with others and expressing themsel
 ves.​\nFood allergy notice: Please be aware that food will be used in th
 is program. Certain food ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some 
 people.​\nThis is an in person program for Teens. Registration is requir
 ed.\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Pub
 lic Library under the\nPublic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and
  20(d). The information will only be used for\nevent and program registrat
 ion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library\nhandles yo
 ur information can be directed to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 
 416-397-\n5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
