SUMMARY:GitHub Copilot Dev Days | Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Enterprise DevOps User Group\nJoin us for a community-
 led developer event focused on **AI-assisted coding with GitHub Copilot**.
  This event brings together developers to explore practical workflows\, re
 al-world use cases\, and hands-on experiences using GitHub Copilot.\n\nWhe
 ther you are new to GitHub Copilot or already using it\, this event will h
 elp you better understand how to apply AI-assisted coding techniques in ev
 eryday development.\n\n* **Total duration:** approximately 3 hours\n* Incl
 udes: **2 technical sessions AND hands-on workshop (1 hour)**\n\n> ***Impo
 rtant*** *This event includes hands-on labs\, so you will need to bring yo
 ur **own laptop** (and power cord)\, if you would like to participate in t
 he lab.*\n\n**Agenda:**\n5:15-5:30pm – Check-in & Networking\n5:30pm –
  Welcome & Opening\n5:45pm – Session 1: GitHub Copilot in Practice (Dave
  Lloyd & Max Yermakhanov)\n6:15pm – Session 2: From Copilot to Colleague
 s: Building an AI DevOps Agent Team (Kaan Turgut)\n6:45pm – Workshop: Ha
 nds-on with GitHub Copilot\n7:45pm – Closing & Next Steps
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-enterprise-devops-user-group/
 events/313279153/
