DESCRIPTION:Think you’ve got what it takes to run the field?\nJoin us al
 l March Break for a week of Madden action on PS5!\nWhether you're a rookie
  or a seasoned QB\, this is your chance to sharpen your skills\, call the 
 plays\, and dominate the gridiron.\n🏈\nMarch 16–19\nPractice Days\nLe
 arn the controls\, test strategies\, build your team\, and get comfortable
  with the game.\n🏆\nMarch 20\nTournament Day\nBracket-style competition
  to crown the Youth Hub Madden Champion!\n🎁\nGrand Prize:\nA replica fo
 otball for the ultimate MVP.\nBring your game face.\nCall your plays.\nCha
 se the championship.\nDrop in and get ready to compete!\n🎮🔥\nProgram
  held at the Youth Hub.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth 
 Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, wher
 e helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offere
 d daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find o
 ut more.
LOCATION:Woodside Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a093b0b48451fc3c0558b7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
