DESCRIPTION:Olivia Skelhorne-Gross reads from her book\nRound and Round th
 e Garden\nfeaturing beautiful embroidered illustrations of nursery rhymes 
 and songs from various cultures around the world.  The unique embroidered 
 images in the book are an introduction to the possibilities of embroidery 
 as an art form and the author will provide a demonstration of the craft.
