 osters teamwork\, patience\, and confidence through engaging\, accessible 
 activities.\nThis program is for ages 6-12 years old.\nRegistration is req
 uired.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
