DESCRIPTION:Join Black Creek Community Farm’s Urban Harvest team this Ma
 rch Break at York Woods Public Library! Engage in a family friendly hands 
 on pickling workshop and bring home a jar of vegetable pickles! Enjoy a fu
 n game of learning how to store different foods in the fridge including yo
 ur favorite snacks!\nKnow how to organize produce in the fridge so foods l
 asts longer\nDiscover the different zones in the fridge and where to best 
 store different foods\nLearn to pickle vegetable odd and ends in your frid
 ge and reduce food waste!\nDrop-in only\n\, no large groups\nAccessibility
 \nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign language interpretation\, int
 ervenor services\, or attendant services are available upon request. Pleas
 e submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to:\ntpl.ca/accessibilit
 y-events\n.
