BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://orpheuschoirtoronto.com/2025-2026-concert-season/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Orpheus Choir: Rejoice in the Lamb
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T193000
UID:8773834f27e5e3c17a1603c578f1c2f1@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join over a hundred voices for an epic performance of some of 
 the British choral tradition's most cherished works including Gustav Holst
 ’s Psalm 148\, and the Canadian premiere of Imogen Holst’s orchestrati
 on of Britten's Rejoice in the Lamb. \n\nThese masterpieces frame Karl Jen
 kins’ genre-defying\, cross-cultural Requiem\, which combines the tradit
 ional Latin text with Japanese death poems and the resonance of a full orc
 hestra with traditional Japanese instruments. A vibrant celebration of lif
 e's passages! \nCategories: Cultural\, Live Performances\, Music
