SUMMARY:Sewing Basics
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260323T140000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260323T160000Z
UID:6994a8194a9fd98b7f7e9a41@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn to sew or would like a refresher on how to use a
  sewing machine? Our intro to sewing course will cover the basics of threa
 ding the machine\, basic stitches and more. We will be creating a small po
 uch. All materials will be provided.\nChildren under 13 must be accompanie
 d by an adult.\nRegistration is required for this class and begins March 9
 th\, 2026 at 12:30 pm.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 min
 utes of the start of the program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe per
 sonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library 
 under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The i
 nformation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery
  and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information 
 can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981
 \, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, 2nd Floor - eLearning Lab
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994a8194a9fd98b7f7e9a41
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
