DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260324T213000Z
UID:696be27691e4576f847d27d5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you 55+? Do you have a phone\, tablet or computer you don'
 t know how to use or want to learn to use better? Do you enjoy meeting new
  people? Seniors E-Connect will help you learn tech topics in a fun group
  setting\, but with the one-on-one help of a teen volunteer.\nIf you're a 
 teen between ages 13 - 17 interested in applying to become a volunteer\, e
 mail bestaff@tpl.ca or ask front desk for Seniors E-Connect application fo
 rm. *Registration Full*
LOCATION:Beaches\, Program Room
