SUMMARY:Union Samples : Soku (Hokkaido Milk)
DESCRIPTION:Yotsuba is one of Japan’s most popular milk producers\, known for its clean\, fresh taste from Hokkaido – Japan’s dairy heartland. By working directly with Japanese producers\, Soku ensures that the same authenticity reaches North America with care. Visit us at Union Station on March 25th to enjoy a full 200ml carton\, perfectly sized for your day on the go.  \nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times. \nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-soku-hokkaido-milk/
LOCATION:Bay Union Samples Kiosk\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Soku-x-Yotsuba-x-Union-e1772034932196.png
END:VEVENT
