DESCRIPTION:In this more advanced 3D Design class\, participants will look
  at the various design tools and functions within Blender that they can us
 e specifically for 3D printing.\nIt is strongly recommended that participa
 nts take 3D Fundamentals with Blender Part I or have a basic working knowl
 edge of Blender before taking this class.\nRegistration is required. Compu
 ters will provided for this class.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pe
 rsonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library
