X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Dinosaurs! 
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260327T190000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260327T190000
UID:1a448e4969c892d45e7dfbdba00e3fd8@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by award-winning science communicator Anthony Morgan\, 
 enjoy a film that explores the ongoing rise and fall of lives on Earth\, f
 rom the cataclysmic events that reshape our ecosystems to the creatures th
 at survived (or did not) along the way\, with live music accompaniment by 
 artists from The Royal Conservatory. \n\nArrive early and explore artifact
 s from the Royal Ontario Museum\n\nCategories: Film\, Museum\, Music
LOCATION:Koerner Hall\, Royal Conservatory of Music\, 273 Bloor St W\, Tor
 onto\, ON\, M5S 1W2
URL:https://www.rcmusic.com/events-and-performances/dinosaurs!
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
