SUMMARY:Puppet Show: The Paper Bag Princess
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T153000Z
UID:69a08fe72866a5b4883e8e7d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Watch the children's classic\nThe Paper Bag Princess\nby Rober
 t Munsch come alive in our puppet show performance!\nWhen the fiercest dra
 gon in the whole world smashes Princess Elizabeth's castle\, burns all her
  clothes\, and captures her fiancé\, Prince Ronald\, Elizabeth takes matt
 ers into her own hands. With her wits alone and nothing but a paper bag to
  wear\, the princess challenges the dragon to show his strength in the hop
 es of saving the prince.\nFor children 3 and up. Drop in.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a08fe72866a5b4883e8e7d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
