SUMMARY:Family Movies - Elio
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T163000Z
UID:6994deea4a9fd98b7f7ea7e3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nElio\nElio\, a space fanatic with 
 an active imagination\, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he mu
 st form new bonds with alien lifeforms\, navigate a crisis of intergalacti
 c proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994deea4a9fd98b7f7ea7e3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
