DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260331T233000Z
UID:698f4f6a6724c63d00f2871b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Make your own Easter egg using the art of Pysanky\; a Ukrainia
 n technique that utilizes wax and dyes. Children only\, ages 10+.\nAdult s
 upervision is required.\nPlease register only the children who will be par
 ticipating in the craft. Adults do not need to register.
