 ute Map with GPX Download Available:\nhttps://www.komoot.com/tour/27791343
 15\n\n1 :30 PM to 2:30 PM Near the start of this walk and not far off rout
 e\, we eat at Grillies ( Highway 7 - Markham)\, 4580 York Regional Rd 7\, 
 Unionville\, ON L3R 1M5\, +1 905 944 1010\n\n2:30 PM to 6 PM walk North on
  Main St. to TooGood pond. Then follow the Rouge Valley Trail Eastward. Re
 turn to Unionville GO.
