SUMMARY:20s 30s Social Party & Activities in toronto
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\nHey Toronto!\n\nThis is y
 our weekly escape into global cultures.\n\n[[[Click this WhatsApp Groupcha
 t Link to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/GyoGCkYt392Bi8c9nOP2d4) ]\n\nEve
 ry Saturday at 7:30 PM\, people in their 20s and 30s gather for a mix of l
 anguage practice\, travel stories\, and community.\n\nWhether you’re new
  in town or born here\, this is where world citizens connect.\n\nNo judgme
 nt\, no pressure — just pure\, human interaction.
