DESCRIPTION:If you love stickers this is the program for you. Relax and be
  mindful as you create your very own themed sticker room. Supplies are pro
 vided.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcom
 ing place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff a
 re always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by
  a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
