UID:699766e6b0595799c09e00ee@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A hands-on workshop where participants will become familiar wi
 th working in a 3D environment by creating simple 3D objects using Autodes
 k Fusion software.\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Collection Noti
 ce:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Pub
 lic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 
