SUMMARY:Best Of
DESCRIPTION:TechTO\n\\*\\*This is a paid event\, please register via our L
 uma Page. You need to have a ticket in order to attend this event: https:/
 /luma.com/bestof-apr-13-2026\n\n**Best Of TechTO is our annual night to ce
 lebrate what Toronto’s tech community is building - and to meet the peop
 le behind it.**\n\nSince day one\, 700+ founders have taken the TechTO sta
 ge and 60\,000+ community members have shown up with the same goal: learn 
 something new\, meet someone new.\n\nThis year we’re bringing Best Of to
  **Toronto City Hall** for an evening of founder stories\, live demos\, st
 andout showcases\, and the kind of conversations that don’t happen on Sl
 ack. Great food + drinks included - all under those iconic arches.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/techto/events/313448186/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260220T171148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260220T171148Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
