SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Henna Art with Hina
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T210000Z
UID:69581cb5a22bb2a9c96fbf12@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub for a special presentation by henna a
 rtist Hina Yasir! Hina will do a deep dive into the history and art of hen
 na designs\, and then demonstrate popular henna techniques. Participants w
 ill be able to use cones of real henna to create designs.\nThis program is
  part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens aft
 er school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. F
 ree\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth
  Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69581cb5a22bb2a9c96fbf12
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
