SUMMARY:Senses\, Stanzas & Symbols in Poetry
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T203000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T220000Z
UID:698b6f298ef687c592a786f5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach Shelly Campbell teaches participants how to use the five
  senses to deepen and expand poetic imagery\, using the analysis of poetry
  and lyrics to explore metaphor\, simile and sensory description.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698b6f298ef687c592a786f5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
