 1c2599e757/6994b732dc5e4493d46d362c/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Toronto\, get ready for an unforgettable night of Ja
 panese pop music as MADKID and Zenbu Kimi no Sei da take the stage for a 
 special one-night-only live...
