 orm effects\, cropping\, video stabilization\, adjusting clip speed\, norm
 alizing audio\, and simple compositing.\nComputers will be provided for th
 is program\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on th
 is form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librar
 ies Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be
