BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Toronto Postgres": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/311976671/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_postgres_to
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Postgres
UID:event_311976671@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260303T215746Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260421T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260423T200000
SUMMARY:Postgres Conference: 2026!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Postgres\nThe one\, the only\, [Postgres Conference!](
 https://postgresconf.og/)\n\n* **[Call for Paper open until Friday\, Janua
 ry 30. 2026](https://postgresconf.org/conferences/postgresconf_2026/progra
 m/proposals/new)**\n\nSince 2007\, Postgres Conference has been the destin
 ation for connecting with the Postgres Ecosystem in North America. Join us
  for a three day event which includes training\, breakout sessions and tut
 orials. Tracks include:\n\n* **Postgres Extensions Day:** Do you develop P
 ostgres Extensions?\nDo you want to develop Postgres Extensions?\nThis day
 /track is for you!\n* **Dev:** All about developing with PostgreSQL. This 
 can be about using extensions like pg_vector to increase your search perfo
 rmance to how to write a new data type.\n* **Ops:** Talks on the operation
 al practices of Postgres and related technologies.\n* **Essentials:** Data
 types\, How do I and data types oh my! If it is in the docs\, or should be
  an isn't... this is where you elaborate on all the glory that is Postgres
  Essentials. Do not overlook this track it is job security.\n* **Life and 
 Fun:** Nothing about Postgres goes here. Do you want to talk about your be
 ehive\, backyard garden\, homestead\, solar\, latest IoT project\, mountai
 n biking or camping? This is the place.\n* **Professional Development & We
 llness:** Career enhancement\, dealing with burnout and the false ideal of
  a work life balance. This is where you find peers to help with all kinds 
 of life problems and opportunities.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/311976671/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251112T175210Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251112T175210Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
