SUMMARY:Learn Medieval Arts\, science\, dancing and games!
DESCRIPTION:Medieval Renaissance Toronto Royal Citie of Eoforwic SCA\nGo M
 edieval!\n\nLearn Medieval arts\, sciences\, dancing and games! Have somef
 un with like minded history geeks.\n\nTuesdays\, 6:30 pm to 8:30 pm\nSt. A
 ndrew’s United Church\n117 Bloor St EAST (near Church Street)\nRing the 
 buzzer for the gate keeper\n\nmore info? www.eoforwic.ca
