SUMMARY:Game On!
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T193000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T213000Z
UID:694aeed81e64afd01e5088d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Level up your free time at the library after school!\nTeens ar
 e invited to drop in\, hang out\, and connect with friends in a relaxed\, 
 welcoming space. Dive into some casual play or friendly competition with p
 opular video games for Switch and PS4/5\, or enjoy some unplugged fun with
  board games when you need a screen break.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/694aeed81e64afd01e5088d6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6967cef8c719ac98c336e37c"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Video Games
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T194500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T230000Z
UID:6967cef8c719ac98c336e37c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in to the Youth Hub every Tuesday and Thursday to play vi
 deo games. Play with friends\, by yourself\, or maybe someone new.\nTuesda
 ys will be Nintendo Switch days and Thursdays will be PS4 days.\n*NEW* Sta
 rting at 3:30 pm\, teens can sign up for a time slot to use the consoles. 
 If there is no demand\, gaming will be awarded on a first come first serve
  basis.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welco
 ming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff 
 are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop b
 y a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6967cef8c719ac98c336e37c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
