SUMMARY:The Active Voice: Personal Storytelling in Poetry
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T213000Z
UID:698b6f262a787a47a5e700b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach Shelly Campbell teaches participants how to use conversa
 tional writing in poetry to create imaginative work that is grounded in em
 otional truth\, precise vocabulary and lived experience.
LOCATION:Brookbanks\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698b6f262a787a47a5e700b2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
