X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69711e66992fc18a86deb24f"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Study Hall Wednesdays
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T220000Z
UID:69711e66992fc18a86deb24f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:On Wednesdays\, the Eatonville Youth Hub becomes a quiet space
  for teens to study\, work on projects\, and request homework help and res
 ume help from staff. Bring your homework and enjoy a snack in a space that
  is just for teens.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs
  are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where he
 lpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered da
 ily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out m
 ore.
LOCATION:Eatonville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69711e66992fc18a86deb24f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699767f3b0595799c09e0105"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Animation with Piskel for Kids
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T210000Z
UID:699767f3b0595799c09e0105@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Kids will learn how to make a simple pixel animation using the
  online Piskel app. Piskel can be used to create simple game sprites (i.e.
 \, 2D images overlaid onto a scene)\, GIF animations\, and pixel-art for s
 ocial media.\nThis program was designed for children ages 8 and up.\nRegis
 tration is required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
 on. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direct
 ed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge 
 Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Bagshaw Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699767f3b0595799c09e0105
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
