DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub for a round of fast trivia! The top t
 hree participants will receive prizes.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub 
 service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in th
 e summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious sn
 acks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the b
 ranch to find out more.
LOCATION:York Woods\, Youth Hub
