SUMMARY:Bad Art Night
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260427T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260427T233000Z
UID:6994ebf3cbf1533ca53780bd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Forget perfection and embrace chaos in a glorious celebration 
 of creativity\, where the only rule is: make something terrible on purpose
 . Whether you're a seasoned artist or a total newbie who can't draw a stra
 ight line\, this is your moment to shine. Drop in.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994ebf3cbf1533ca53780bd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
