DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260429T203000Z
UID:693f0b1b4be11d3d00d817ba@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! Drop-in\, space is limited.\nFebruary 25: Slime\nMarch 4: LEGO Club\
 nMarch 11: Karaoke night\nMarch 25: Fun with Dash\nSnacks are offered duri
 ng the After School Club for participants.\nFood may contain or have come 
 into contact with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be available. Sn
 acks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room. Lower Level.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/693f0b1b4be11d3d00d817ba
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
