DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 26 years of ink at Canada’s longest-running and mo
 st iconic tattoo convention!\n\nWhether you're looking to get tattooed by 
 a top artist\, discover the latest in tattoo culture\, or just immerse you
 rself in the inked lifestyle\, this is the place to be.\n\nEnjoy live tatt
 ooing\, vendors\, art\, entertainment\, contests and much more all weekend
  long. Bookings and walk-up appointments available.\n\nDon’t miss this l
 egendary 3-day celebration of art\, expression\, and community.\n\nCategor
 ies: Arts/Exhibits\, Consumer Show/Convention\, Cultural
