DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T193000
UID:2f28f647f58a670f4987c1cd3f2cfb7f@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Wrapping up the 2025-26 season with works of eternal genius! \
 n\nThe superb young Toronto pianist Vanessa Yu joins the ensemble in one o
 f the greatest concertos of all time\, Beethoven's noble Piano Concerto No
 . 5\, the "Emperor". Music Director Nurhan Arman leads the orchestra in Dm
 itri Shostakovich's poignant and personal Chamber Symphony in C minor Op. 
 110a and finishes with the powerful reassurance of J.S. Bach's Contrapunct
 us 1 and 2 in beautifully transparent orchestral versions.\nCategories: Li
 ve Performances\, Music
LOCATION:George Weston Recital Hall\, Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge St
 \, North York\, ON\, M2N 6R8
