DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260504T230000Z
UID:69710fba76261f280065baa0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in on Mondays to challenge your friends to a match of Mar
 io Kart or FIFA\, or chill out with some solo play. Length of play session
 s may be limited based on interest and availability\, available on a first
 -come-first-serve basis.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth
  Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, whe
 re helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offer
 ed daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find 
 out more.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Youth Hub\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69710fba76261f280065baa0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
