DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260508T000000Z
UID:699f5cc78b29ea2800d27a0c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a radical retro rewind projected on the big s
 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nFebruary 26: If Beale Street Could Talk (2018\, 14A)
 \nMarch 5: The Social Network (2010\, PG)\nMarch 12: Steve Jobs (2015\, R
 )\nMarch 19: Michael Clayton (2007\, 14A)\nMarch 26: Ocean’s Twelve (2
 004\, PG)\nAll are welcome. Drop-in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
