SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 PERU ADVENTURE: INCA TRAIL Trek to Machu Picchu (8 Day
 s): May 9-16\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\n⭐️ AN INCREDIBLE HIKING & CAMPING ADVENTUR
 E IN THE PERUVIAN ANDES FROM CUSCO TO MACHU PICCHU ⭐️\n(Includes all c
 amping supplies and round-trip flight Lima-Cusco)\n\n**May 9–16\, 2026**
  • 8 Days / 7 Nights\n\n**Difficulty level:** **Intermediate** (recent e
 xperience hiking 14 Km (8.7 mi) a day or more required).\n\n**Max 16 parti
 cipants**\n\n⭐️⭐️ PRICE: CAD **$3\,350**\n\n**• HIGHLIGHTS**\nEx
 perience the thrill of a lifetime with this hiking adventure in one of the
  world's most iconic destinations for outdoor and culture enthusiasts – 
 Peru’s ancient **Inca Trail** to **Machu Picchu**\, a UNESCO World Herit
 age Site.\nJoin us on this fully escorted and guided tour of spectacular *
 *Peru** and retrace the steps of the Incas – Peru's fascinating ancient 
 civilization. Beginning in **Lima**\, the country’s capital flanked by S
 panish colonial architecture\, you’ll journey through the fertile heartl
 and of the **Sacred Valley**\, see the magnificent **Ollantaytambo** ruins
  and take on the world-renowned Inca Trail to Machu Picchu – nestled hig
 h in the **Andes**\, this is one of the Seven Wonders of the World… AND 
 MORE!\n\n**• ITINERARY**\nVISIT [https://intrepid.wetravel.com/i/68704a4
 7d4f8f8b11938b4e6](https://intrepid.wetravel.com/i/68704a47d4f8f8b11938b4e
 6)\n\n⭐️ ⭐️ HOW TO REGISTER ⭐️ ⭐️\n**[>> Please\, Click HE
 RE <<](https://intrepid.wetravel.com/i/68704a47d4f8f8b11938b4e6)**[ ](http
 s://intrepid.wetravel.com/i/68704a47d4f8f8b11938b4e6)to see the full descr
 iption and register via **Intrepid Travel\,** Canada (TICO Reg. **N. 50020
 269**)\n\n⭐️ Event offered in conjunction with via Intrepid Travel\, a
  global leader in small-group experiential tours\, est. in 1989 ([Intrepid
 Travel.com](http://intrepidtravel.com/)) ⭐️
