SUMMARY:After School Club
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260512T193000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260512T203000Z
UID:696abaf8b0595799c096d203@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6-12.\nDrop-in.\nUpcoming Programs:\nMarch 3 - Basketball 
 with Dash\nMarch 10 - DIY Bookmarks\nMarch 17 - No ASC Session - March Bre
 ak program in place\nMarch 24 - Soccer with Sphero\nMarch 31 - Easter Bunn
 y Masks\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for participants.
 \nFood may contain or have come into contact with common allergens. Ingred
 ient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, 
 by donors.\nIf you or your child lives with a disability\, and requires an
  accessibility accommodation to participate in this program\, please conta
 ct Accessibility Services by email\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voicem
 ail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please contact us at least three w
 eeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696abaf8b0595799c096d203
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6967cef8c719ac98c336e382"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Video Games
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260512T194500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260512T230000Z
UID:6967cef8c719ac98c336e382@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in to the Youth Hub every Tuesday and Thursday to play vi
 deo games. Play with friends\, by yourself\, or maybe someone new.\nTuesda
 ys will be Nintendo Switch days and Thursdays will be PS4 days.\n*NEW* Sta
 rting at 3:30 pm\, teens can sign up for a time slot to use the consoles. 
 If there is no demand\, gaming will be awarded on a first come first serve
  basis.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welco
 ming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff 
 are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop b
 y a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
