DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260515T210000Z
UID:698b6f238ef687c592a786f3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach Shelly Campbell teaches participants techniques such as 
 rhyme\, pacing\, and alliteration in spoken word poetry. Participants will
  then write a poem focused on using rhythm and repetition.
