 with Dash\nMarch 10 - DIY Bookmarks\nMarch 17 - No ASC Session - March Bre
 ak program in place\nMarch 24 - Soccer with Sphero\nMarch 31 - Easter Bunn
 y Masks\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for participants.
 \nFood may contain or have come into contact with common allergens. Ingred
 ient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, 
 by donors.\nIf you or your child lives with a disability\, and requires an
  accessibility accommodation to participate in this program\, please conta
