BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Toronto Arts & Culture": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-arts-and-culture/events/312595541/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_arts_culture
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Arts & Culture
UID:event_312595541@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260303T215734Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T140000
SUMMARY:OTTAWA: Culture in the Capital    (8th annual visit)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nCan you join us in **Ottawa**?\n\n*For
  our annual culture long weekend! **Our 8th year.***\n\nDates/details are 
 now FIRM--thinking about early summer Culture!\n\nPLEASE read everything o
 ver before signing up--all the details are here.\n\nAs optimism builds for
  a different year (more comfortable) in 2026 then we had in previous years
 --we will continue to explore the culture scene in some of our favorite Ci
 ties. **A deep dive/below the surface.**\n\nEach year we bounce back and f
 orth between Montreal & Ottawa.\n\nThis year in Ottawa--we'll also spend s
 ome time in **GATINEAU** for the first time--we can ***WALK*** between dow
 ntown Ottawa and downtown Gatineau (it takes just 30 minutes!!)\n\nThis wi
 ll be our 8th 'long weekend' Ottawa trip since 2015. (--not the sleepy cit
 y you think it is--)\n\n**Very important\, PLEASE read all the information
  over before you RSVP.**\n\n**You must contact me first. There is a *Non-R
 efundable fee* to join us. Emailed/payable when you are confirmed. $100 pe
 r person**\n\n**Our 2026 Ottawa trip will be built around**--our favorite 
 contemporary galleries\, architecture\, public art\, The National Gallery\
 , and its **Doors Open Ottawa** weekend +++ food/drink\n\n**Plus our other
  usual favorite stops\,** and a Group dinner.\n\nAll in 2 1/2 days!!\n\nWe
  are on the go each day from 10:30am-9pm\, and **walk** everywhere.\n\nOtt
 awa is the least expensive of our trips--perhaps $1000 all in?\n\nWhat els
 e do we do? Some combo of:\n\n-visit other private/public galleries\n-arch
 itecture tour/talks/walks\n-Indigenous exploration\n-public outdoor art\n-
 food/drink\n-other things which we don't yet know about\n-much of what we 
 do is FREE\n\n**Note:** there is so much going on in Ottawa with regards t
 o ART and CULTURE--don't think otherwise! We are welcomed everywhere.\n\nT
 his is a 3-night trip. The dates of this trip are AFTER the Ottawa Tulip F
 estival.\n\n**How these trips work:**\n\n**YOU look after** your travel an
 d accommodations (everyone has own personal budgets)\, **I look after** ev
 erything else. I plan ALL our activities on the ground while we are togeth
 er. From first night drink/gallery visit (Thursday)\, to last night's grou
 p dinner (Saturday). You leave as you like on Sunday.\n\n1. 3 nights (Thur
 sday\, Friday\, Saturday) We meet as a group on Thursday at 5pm SHARP.\n2.
  VIA train is currently showing $150 round trip ticket. How will you get t
 here\, where will you stay? Drive\, bus\, train\, fly? (Your Presto card w
 orks in Ottawa--on public transit!)\n3. Will you drive your car? Use 'poin
 ts' for accommodations? Airbnb\, B&B\, Hotel\, other? Do you need any insu
 rance? You should aim to stay within a 15 mins walk of downtown/Byward Mar
 ket. We walk everywhere!\n4. There is a **NON-refundable fee sent to me wh
 en you signup/RSVP--due within 2 days.** I organize everything on the grou
 nd\, discounts\, tours\, reservations etc. **TRIP FEE for 2026 is $100 per
  person.**\n5. We will start with 10 people..until we know more about grou
 p sizing. But no more than 12 people.\n6. Build into your trip budget: $75
  for tickets/tours/entry\, and $125 for our famous last night **group dinn
 er**--we always find someplace special/memorable. Excellent OTTAWA food sc
 ene.\n7. And of course\, with all our trips there are always special/vip t
 ype surprises.\n8. Agenda/schedule/Details in due course. You want to be i
 n Ottawa and able to MEET up by **5pm on Thursday June 4th**. At the Natio
 nal Gallery.\n\nPlease read everything over before signing up. I keep you 
 in the loop as per our planning\, with a final schedule sent to you a few 
 weeks before.\n\nThank you for your interest!\n\nYou can connect with me (
 Greg) at\n[torontoisculture@gmail.com](http://torontoisculture@gmail.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-arts-and-culture/events/31259
 5541/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251227T125508Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251227T125508Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
