DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260606T200000
UID:aee7417132ec404b1d273b0035712cda@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Amazing magic. Tremendous trickery. Hilarious antics.\n\nGet r
 eady to have your mind blown! Watch as the world’s most legendary magici
 ans\, Pen and Teller celebrate their milestone anniversary. The celebrated
  duo will blend classic favourites with astonishing new illusions\, all de
 livered with their trademark wit and showmanship for an unforgettable live
  experience.\n\nDavid Letterman lauds them as “evil geniuses—always am
 azing\, always entertaining\,” while The New York Times hails their act 
 as “a witheringly funny\, brazen assault on the temple of magic\,” and
  The Times of London declares that “the comedy-magic duo are at their ab
 solute peak:.\nCategories: Comedy\, Live Performances
LOCATION:Meridian Hall\, 1 Front St E\, Toronto\, ON\, M5E 1B2
URL:https://www.luminatofestival.com/PennTeller
