BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://www.luminatofestival.com/play-dead"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Play Dead
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260625T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260628T160000
UID:495db7d93771795f1d9f61e3994ddf88@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Play Dead invites you into a distorted world where the familia
 r twists into something wonderful and strange. Everyday rituals warp into 
 surreal scenes\, exposing the desperation that underpins our search for co
 nnection. In this gravity-defying universe\, bodies collide and tangle\, c
 aught between beauty and menace — both intimate and unsettling.\n\nMontr
 eal’s People Watching crafts a vivid blend of acrobatics\, movement\, an
 d high octane circus that magnifies the absurdity of the everyday. These m
 oments\, strange yet achingly familiar\, mirror our own desire to hold on\
 , like couples not wanting the last dance to end.\n\nHaunting and exhilara
 ting\, Play Dead captures the fragility\, absurdity\, and fleeting wonder 
 of life lived on the edge of connection.\n\nLa Presse lauds the performanc
 e as “Masterful fluidity\, breathtaking…the circus of tomorrow".\nCate
 gories: Dance\, Live Performances
LOCATION:Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge St\, North York\, ON\, M2N 6R8
URL:https://www.luminatofestival.com/play-dead
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
