SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 HIKING IN THE ALPS OF TRENTINO\, ITALY ⭐️July 2026
  (7 Days)
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\n⭐️ **A GUIDED HIKING TOUR OF THE ITALIAN A
 LPS** ⭐️\n(Includes most meals\, 5 guided hikes and private round-trip
  trail shuttle service)\n\n**July 25-31\, 2026** • 7 Days / 6 Nights\n\n
 **Difficulty level:** Beginner/ Intermediate (some hiking experience requi
 red)\n\n• **Price:** From EUR 1\,550.00 pp (about CAD $2\,500)\nFlight N
 OT incl.\n\n**Max 17 participants**\n\n• HIGHLIGHTS\nExplore the towerin
 g mountain peaks\, bright-green valleys and quaint villages of the **Dolom
 ites** (UNESCO Heritage Site) in the **Trentino** region of Italy.\nFrom *
 *Val di Sole\,** a central site that will allow you to easily reach the st
 arting points of each day hike\, you will experience excursions of great s
 atisfaction and with significantly different environmental characteristics
 . You will explore the jagged peaks of the **Brent**a Dolomites and the to
 nalite-rock mountains of **Adamello**\, and move on to the sunny southern 
 side of the **Ortles-Cevedale** chain\, a territory which falls mostly wit
 hin the protected area of ​​the **Stelvio National Park**... AND MORE!
 \n\n• ITINERARY\nVISIT [https://www.campobase.travel/en/experiences/trav
 el/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trentino/](https://www.campobase.travel/en/experi
 ences/travel/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trentino/)\n\n⭐️ ⭐️ HOW TO REGI
 STER ⭐️ ⭐️\n[>> Please\, Click HERE <<](https://www.campobase.trav
 el/en/experiences/travel/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trentino/)[ ](https://wildo
 ntours.com/products/italy-july-23)to see the full description and register
  via **Campo Base.**\n\n⭐️ Event offered in conjunction with Campo Bas
 e -- an Italian company specializing in adventure trips (CampoBase.travel)
  ⭐️
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/hikingnetwork/events/313243928/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260206T232114Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260206T232114Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
